# Optional external origin for the generated map data.
#
# Unset (the default) serves everything from this repo's `public/data` tree,
# which is what `pnpm dev` expects after `git lfs pull`.
#
# Set it to an object store or CDN origin to run the app without the multi-
# gigabyte data tree checked out locally. The value is prepended to every
# `/data/...` path, so the bucket must mirror the `data/paleo-coastlines/...`
# layout exactly. No trailing slash required.
#
# A cross-origin bucket must send `Access-Control-Allow-Origin` for the app to
# read it, and `Timing-Allow-Origin` if you want transfer sizes to show up in
# browser performance timings.
# VITE_DATA_BASE_URL=https://paleo-data.example.workers.dev
